(6444342, 956945, 43774, '<td valign="top">At first I didn''t get the pills, but then I thought maybe they were malaria pills. I don''t get the plate of bread either but perhaps it''s a food that has to do with Africa? I like the photo, it''s really good. I''m not fond of the border though.</td>', 'At first I didn''t get the pills, but then I thought maybe they were malaria pills. I don''t get the plate of bread either but perhaps it''s a food that has to do with Africa? I like the photo, it''s really good. I''m not fond of the border though.', '2011-06-15 10:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
