(6444510, 956279, 33233, '<td valign="top">I like the shoes as representation of family members. I think composition could be a bit better...maybe not quite to tight a crop. I think the contrast could be a bit better, particularly with the tennis shoe. The contrast with boot looks good which makes this a challenge for the tennis shoe...particularly given the basic edit rules.</td>', 'I like the shoes as representation of family members. I think composition could be a bit better...maybe not quite to tight a crop. I think the contrast could be a bit better, particularly with the tennis shoe. The contrast with boot looks good which makes this a challenge for the tennis shoe...particularly given the basic edit rules.', '2011-06-15 14:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6444512, 956816, 33233, '<td valign="top">The image is very nice. The contrast and lighting are wonderful. The soft shadows in the foreground and the harsh shadow creating a separate image in the background add interest. Good composition as well. The problem I have with this image is I don''t understand how it is symbolic of the title.</td>', 'The image is very nice. The contrast and lighting are wonderful. The soft shadows in the foreground and the harsh shadow creating a separate image in the background add interest. Good composition as well. The problem I have with this image is I don''t understand how it is symbolic of the title.', '2011-06-15 15:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6444513, 956987, 33233, '<td valign="top">So you would have had to have read Kafka to understand the symbology of this image. The texture and imagery play well into the Kafka theme. This is superb.</td>', 'So you would have had to have read Kafka to understand the symbology of this image. The texture and imagery play well into the Kafka theme. This is superb.', '2011-06-15 15:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
