(6444822, 956945, 96751, '<td valign="top">Interesting collection of items.  I''m not sure what it all means, although it is very artfully arranged, and the lighting is very nice.  My take on this has to do with AIDS in Africa, with the pills representing medication for that, and the flowers in memory of those who''ve died from it.  But the crumbled stuff...?</td>', 'Interesting collection of items.  I''m not sure what it all means, although it is very artfully arranged, and the lighting is very nice.  My take on this has to do with AIDS in Africa, with the pills representing medication for that, and the flowers in memory of those who''ve died from it.  But the crumbled stuff...?', '2011-06-15 23:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6444823, 956979, 96751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tableau, although what is that giant bug doing there?</td>', 'Beautiful tableau, although what is that giant bug doing there?', '2011-06-15 23:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6444824, 956418, 96751, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea, powerful message.  But for me, the lighting is very "meh" - all the tones are in the same range.  I think even just a bit of brightness and contrast would have made this even more impactful.</td>', 'Excellent idea, powerful message.  But for me, the lighting is very "meh" - all the tones are in the same range.  I think even just a bit of brightness and contrast would have made this even more impactful.', '2011-06-15 23:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6444825, 956903, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great light and set-up, although I''m not seeing the connection to pornography or eroticism.</td>', 'Great light and set-up, although I''m not seeing the connection to pornography or eroticism.', '2011-06-15 23:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6444826, 956750, 96751, '<td valign="top">How marvelous!!!!  What a sweet idea, beautiful use of lensbaby.  Very creative.</td>', 'How marvelous!!!!  What a sweet idea, beautiful use of lensbaby.  Very creative.', '2011-06-15 23:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6444833, 956965, 125275, '<td valign="top">Simple and well executed, no pun intended! Nice lighting as well. I definitely wouldn''t call this a "still" life, but I''m not splitting hairs! :-D</td>', 'Simple and well executed, no pun intended! Nice lighting as well. I definitely wouldn''t call this a "still" life, but I''m not splitting hairs! :-D', '2011-06-15 23:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6444837, 956945, 18778, '<td valign="top">Awaits what?  Does Africa need some naan?  Is this about drug trafficking? Perhaps it is my pallet that is unrefined. I do like the vintage look map.  Stylistically- not into the red hairline border.  I really like the over all tone/ colouring of this piece.  And it obviously peeks my curiosity- what is the story here?</td>', 'Awaits what?  Does Africa need some naan?  Is this about drug trafficking? Perhaps it is my pallet that is unrefined. I do like the vintage look map.  Stylistically- not into the red hairline border.  I really like the over all tone/ colouring of this piece.  And it obviously peeks my curiosity- what is the story here?', '2011-06-15 23:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6444842, 957008, 18778, '<td valign="top">I very much appreciate this concept. However... The lighting here is far too brash giving spot light to part of the image and harsh shadows abound. (Perhaps a reflector would help?) I realize still life, by design, is staged. But this is SOOOO staged it feels uncomfortable- as opposed to feeling like a glimpse of ''life'', I feel as though I can here the photographer saying ''Move the knife 2 cm to the left....''  The staging dominates my attention over the idea.</td>', 'I very much appreciate this concept. However... The lighting here is far too brash giving spot light to part of the image and harsh shadows abound. (Perhaps a reflector would help?) I realize still life, by design, is staged. But this is SOOOO staged it feels uncomfortable- as opposed to feeling like a glimpse of ''life'', I feel as though I can here the photographer saying ''Move the knife 2 cm to the left....''  The staging dominates my attention over the idea.', '2011-06-15 23:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6444843, 956955, 18778, '<td valign="top">From this perspective- I feel like I''m hovering over a random pile of crafting tools.  Even with the title, I''m still searching for the idea your trying to convey.  Feels like an ''accidental snap'' from a roll of film, if you''ll pardon the out dated cliche</td>', 'From this perspective- I feel like I''m hovering over a random pile of crafting tools.  Even with the title, I''m still searching for the idea your trying to convey.  Feels like an ''accidental snap'' from a roll of film, if you''ll pardon the out dated cliche', '2011-06-15 23:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6444851, 956920, 18778, '<td valign="top">I. LOVE. THIS.</td>', 'I. LOVE. THIS.', '2011-06-15 23:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6444853, 956896, 18778, '<td valign="top">It''s after 5...so you don''t need to light the candles yet?  It''s after 5... so we''re breaking out the red glasses?  The black counter tops with black background with black bowl and black rocks feels flat.  I do like the way the light goes through the liquid red is reflected onto the clear twisted stem.  I would love to see you explore those lighting possibilities.</td>', 'It''s after 5...so you don''t need to light the candles yet?  It''s after 5... so we''re breaking out the red glasses?  The black counter tops with black background with black bowl and black rocks feels flat.  I do like the way the light goes through the liquid red is reflected onto the clear twisted stem.  I would love to see you explore those lighting possibilities.', '2011-06-16 00:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
