(6444878, 956965, 96751, '<td valign="top">Fantastic! I smell a ribbon, or at least top 10. I don''t know why, but the lighting, detail and execution smacks of <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=114969" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">gyaban</a>.  And if it''s not, consider that the highest possible compliment.  Of course, if it IS Christophe, don''t let it go to your head :-)</td>', 'Fantastic! I smell a ribbon, or at least top 10. I don''t know why, but the lighting, detail and execution smacks of  gyaban.  And if it''s not, consider that the highest possible compliment.  Of course, if it IS Christophe, don''t let it go to your head :-)', '2011-06-16 00:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
