(6444909, 956993, 96751, '<td valign="top">So much can be read into this that it becomes a bit confusing.  First, though, I love the desatted tones.  And the gauze is an interesting texture for the bg.  The apples clearly refer to Adam and Eve, and life, and sin, etc., and they are beautifully captured.  But then the seeds...?  Are those earth?  Or heaven?  I''m not sure having them oof works for the image, or maybe I''m just not understanding what''s going on.</td>', 'So much can be read into this that it becomes a bit confusing.  First, though, I love the desatted tones.  And the gauze is an interesting texture for the bg.  The apples clearly refer to Adam and Eve, and life, and sin, etc., and they are beautifully captured.  But then the seeds...?  Are those earth?  Or heaven?  I''m not sure having them oof works for the image, or maybe I''m just not understanding what''s going on.', '2011-06-16 00:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6444910, 956951, 96751, '<td valign="top">Fooled me.  For a second, I thought they were people!</td>', 'Fooled me.  For a second, I thought they were people!', '2011-06-16 00:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6444912, 956483, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is art.  Magnificent vision, deliriously delicious tones and textures.  This should be 10 ft wide and on the wall.  And if it has meaning beyond its beauty, it''s a bonus.</td>', 'This is art.  Magnificent vision, deliriously delicious tones and textures.  This should be 10 ft wide and on the wall.  And if it has meaning beyond its beauty, it''s a bonus.', '2011-06-16 01:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6444913, 956855, 96751, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how the flowers relate to the egg and feathers...  Love that nest, though</td>', 'I''m not sure how the flowers relate to the egg and feathers...  Love that nest, though', '2011-06-16 01:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6444914, 956870, 96751, '<td valign="top">What an awesome macro.  Not what I''d call "still life".</td>', 'What an awesome macro.  Not what I''d call "still life".', '2011-06-16 01:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6444915, 956944, 96751, '<td valign="top">Flowers might just be the only things that remain beautiful, even when they''re dead.</td>', 'Flowers might just be the only things that remain beautiful, even when they''re dead.', '2011-06-16 01:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6444916, 956918, 96751, '<td valign="top">A very powerful image, indeed, Wendy.</td>', 'A very powerful image, indeed, Wendy.', '2011-06-16 01:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6444917, 956987, 96751, '<td valign="top">There is such a crispness to this image!  And these dueling textures - the ephemeral feather/the crunchy branches/the tight, hard coil of the shell, etc.  The duality of the child''s adorableness, and the grotesqueness of the scarab...  Themes of life and death, preservation and loss.  I love it.</td>', 'There is such a crispness to this image!  And these dueling textures - the ephemeral feather/the crunchy branches/the tight, hard coil of the shell, etc.  The duality of the child''s adorableness, and the grotesqueness of the scarab...  Themes of life and death, preservation and loss.  I love it.', '2011-06-16 01:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6444918, 956984, 96751, '<td valign="top">Ephemeral glass. Contrasting with voluptuous fruit.  Lovely.</td>', 'Ephemeral glass. Contrasting with voluptuous fruit.  Lovely.', '2011-06-16 01:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
