(6445205, 956418, 132967, '<td valign="top">Love the idea for this.  Great color contrast!</td>', 'Love the idea for this.  Great color contrast!', '2011-06-16 16:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6445206, 956882, 132967, '<td valign="top">I really like how you showed the progression of time.  Great idea!</td>', 'I really like how you showed the progression of time.  Great idea!', '2011-06-16 16:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6445207, 957009, 132967, '<td valign="top">Very timeless look!  I like your choice with sepia tones!</td>', 'Very timeless look!  I like your choice with sepia tones!', '2011-06-16 16:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6445208, 957004, 132967, '<td valign="top">Such a great way to honor our troops!  Good job!</td>', 'Such a great way to honor our troops!  Good job!', '2011-06-16 16:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6445209, 956940, 132967, '<td valign="top">I loved the brightness of the colors of the shells!  Very beautiful!</td>', 'I loved the brightness of the colors of the shells!  Very beautiful!', '2011-06-16 16:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6445210, 956870, 132967, '<td valign="top">This was an interesting shot.  Vibrant colors.  What exactly is that white thing?</td>', 'This was an interesting shot.  Vibrant colors.  What exactly is that white thing?', '2011-06-16 16:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6445211, 956119, 132967, '<td valign="top">I liked how peaceful this was.  Great composition.</td>', 'I liked how peaceful this was.  Great composition.', '2011-06-16 16:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6445212, 956384, 132967, '<td valign="top">This was almost too scary to vote on...memories of college...Great picture though!  :-)</td>', 'This was almost too scary to vote on...memories of college...Great picture though!  :-)', '2011-06-16 16:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6445213, 957019, 132967, '<td valign="top">I liked how I had to look at the picture for a while to figure out what it was.  Great composition!</td>', 'I liked how I had to look at the picture for a while to figure out what it was.  Great composition!', '2011-06-16 16:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6445214, 956452, 132967, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea!</td>', 'Interesting idea!', '2011-06-16 16:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6445215, 956794, 132967, '<td valign="top">I liked how this was different.  Foreign money has always interested me.  Great idea!</td>', 'I liked how this was different.  Foreign money has always interested me.  Great idea!', '2011-06-16 16:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6445216, 956984, 132967, '<td valign="top">I really liked how the tops of the bottles almost fade into nothing but then the colors of the berries pop!  Great job!</td>', 'I really liked how the tops of the bottles almost fade into nothing but then the colors of the berries pop!  Great job!', '2011-06-16 16:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6445217, 956541, 132967, '<td valign="top">I''ve taken several waterdrops on spider webs before.  Not an easy task (I always had trouble with focus).  I really like how you were able to capture the sparkle off of the dangling drop!</td>', 'I''ve taken several waterdrops on spider webs before.  Not an easy task (I always had trouble with focus).  I really like how you were able to capture the sparkle off of the dangling drop!', '2011-06-16 16:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6445218, 956918, 132967, '<td valign="top">I like that, even though I would consider this "still life," you were able to capture motion.  Great job!</td>', 'I like that, even though I would consider this "still life," you were able to capture motion.  Great job!', '2011-06-16 16:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6445219, 956613, 132967, '<td valign="top">Pretty, but would hae been so much better had it been a real rose vs. a silk rose.</td>', 'Pretty, but would hae been so much better had it been a real rose vs. a silk rose.', '2011-06-16 16:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6445401, 956941, 133612, '<td valign="top">i gave this a 6 because i think the lighting above all let it down, it seemed too flat.</td>', 'i gave this a 6 because i think the lighting above all let it down, it seemed too flat.', '2011-06-16 21:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6445457, 956965, 112739, '<td valign="top">I think this is the only shot in the whole challenge that made any sense to me and was fun to view.  But not voting.</td>', 'I think this is the only shot in the whole challenge that made any sense to me and was fun to view.  But not voting.', '2011-06-16 22:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6445846, 956952, 118154, '<td valign="top">A bit dark for me ole eyes.</td>', 'A bit dark for me ole eyes.', '2011-06-17 07:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6445849, 956787, 118154, '<td valign="top">Gruesome but works well for the challenge.</td>', 'Gruesome but works well for the challenge.', '2011-06-17 07:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6445851, 956835, 118154, '<td valign="top">Lovely feel to this image.</td>', 'Lovely feel to this image.', '2011-06-17 07:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6445853, 957009, 118154, '<td valign="top">Nicely done,like the tone.</td>', 'Nicely done,like the tone.', '2011-06-17 07:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6445854, 956854, 118154, '<td valign="top">Lol .</td>', 'Lol .', '2011-06-17 07:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6445855, 956964, 118154, '<td valign="top">I like this in a weird sort of way,don,t suppose it will do very well here.But would like to see it.</td>', 'I like this in a weird sort of way,don,t suppose it will do very well here.But would like to see it.', '2011-06-17 07:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6445856, 956765, 118154, '<td valign="top">The lighting spoils this for me,looks like direct flash and therefore has no modeling. Flash off the camera would have improved shot a lot in my view.</td>', 'The lighting spoils this for me,looks like direct flash and therefore has no modeling. Flash off the camera would have improved shot a lot in my view.', '2011-06-17 07:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6445858, 956797, 118154, '<td valign="top">Not sure what this is symbolic of really ?<br/>Don,t want to beat you up but it looks over sharpened as well, Sorry.</td>', 'Not sure what this is symbolic of really ?Don,t want to beat you up but it looks over sharpened as well, Sorry.', '2011-06-17 07:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6445862, 956918, 118154, '<td valign="top">Good image.</td>', 'Good image.', '2011-06-17 07:57:38.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6445863, 956979, 118154, '<td valign="top">I like this shot very much.</td>', 'I like this shot very much.', '2011-06-17 07:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6445865, 956896, 118154, '<td valign="top">Not sure the nearest glass needs to be in shot and the candles should be alight in my view.</td>', 'Not sure the nearest glass needs to be in shot and the candles should be alight in my view.', '2011-06-17 08:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6445866, 956920, 118154, '<td valign="top">Love the desktop.Hope this does well.</td>', 'Love the desktop.Hope this does well.', '2011-06-17 08:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6445867, 956987, 118154, '<td valign="top">Sweet image with nice lighting.</td>', 'Sweet image with nice lighting.', '2011-06-17 08:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6445962, 956987, 47470, '<td valign="top">The color palate on this is gorgeous.  I love the inclusion of the bone and the bug.  I just wish the lines had been straighter/squarer to emphasize the way the photo is boxed in by its border and the objects.</td>', 'The color palate on this is gorgeous.  I love the inclusion of the bone and the bug.  I just wish the lines had been straighter/squarer to emphasize the way the photo is boxed in by its border and the objects.', '2011-06-17 10:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6445965, 956843, 47470, '<td valign="top">I''d love to hear what this means to you.  This one was the first that I''ve seen in the bunch that has sent my mind afire.  The photo could mean any number of things, but the one that I like the best that I came up with is that the peach (as it so often does) represents the female.  The wine represents the perfect female.  And the press represents some of the things (plastic surgery, etc) that females do to try to become the "perfect female."  I"m probably way off on this, but I really liked that idea.<br/> <br/>As for the photo, the technicals are great and I love the simplicity of your set up.</td>', 'I''d love to hear what this means to you.  This one was the first that I''ve seen in the bunch that has sent my mind afire.  The photo could mean any number of things, but the one that I like the best that I came up with is that the peach (as it so often does) represents the female.  The wine represents the perfect female.  And the press represents some of the things (plastic surgery, etc) that females do to try to become the "perfect female."  I"m probably way off on this, but I really liked that idea. As for the photo, the technicals are great and I love the simplicity of your set up.', '2011-06-17 10:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6445968, 956918, 47470, '<td valign="top">The flower may have lost half of its petals, but it still looks like a flower, smells like a flower, and probably makes people smile like only a flower could...</td>', 'The flower may have lost half of its petals, but it still looks like a flower, smells like a flower, and probably makes people smile like only a flower could...', '2011-06-17 10:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6445970, 956269, 47470, '<td valign="top">I think it''s a testament to your idea that I got the "heavy stuff" part before I even read your title.  I do wish the lighting was a bit more emotionally fitting, possibly harsh and contrasty to show some of the unease/frustration/angst a lot people feel when they need to do high level math.</td>', 'I think it''s a testament to your idea that I got the "heavy stuff" part before I even read your title.  I do wish the lighting was a bit more emotionally fitting, possibly harsh and contrasty to show some of the unease/frustration/angst a lot people feel when they need to do high level math.', '2011-06-17 10:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6445972, 957009, 47470, '<td valign="top">Such lovely tones and colors.  Great set up too.  I like that the little bit extra black on the top and sides gives a hint of the isolation that comes with being forgotten.</td>', 'Such lovely tones and colors.  Great set up too.  I like that the little bit extra black on the top and sides gives a hint of the isolation that comes with being forgotten.', '2011-06-17 10:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6445973, 956978, 47470, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of images in this challenge that make use of other photographs in them.  I think this is one of the ones that would have worked just as well (maybe even better) without the photograph(s) because the other objects are so strong.</td>', 'There are a lot of images in this challenge that make use of other photographs in them.  I think this is one of the ones that would have worked just as well (maybe even better) without the photograph(s) because the other objects are so strong.', '2011-06-17 10:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6445975, 957019, 47470, '<td valign="top">A fitting quote : )  I still kinda wish there was the slightest bit of a rim light outlining the flower.</td>', 'A fitting quote : )  I still kinda wish there was the slightest bit of a rim light outlining the flower.', '2011-06-17 10:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6445978, 956979, 134443, '<td valign="top">Love the symbolic contrast and movement from light to dark.<br/>Nice tones.</td>', 'Love the symbolic contrast and movement from light to dark.Nice tones.', '2011-06-17 10:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6445980, 956816, 47470, '<td valign="top">I think this would have worked better with a real (cute-looking) animal instead of the toys, like maybe a chick or a baby pig.  I love the lighting and the shadow at the back.</td>', 'I think this would have worked better with a real (cute-looking) animal instead of the toys, like maybe a chick or a baby pig.  I love the lighting and the shadow at the back.', '2011-06-17 10:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6445984, 956660, 134443, '<td valign="top">A bit depressi</td>', 'A bit depressi', '2011-06-17 10:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6445986, 956835, 134443, '<td valign="top">Intersting shapes and textures.</td>', 'Intersting shapes and textures.', '2011-06-17 10:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6446032, 956384, 67258, '<td valign="top">I suspect that it is important to recognise the forms if the viewer is to understand the symbolism - unfortunately they are completely meaningless to me.</td>', 'I suspect that it is important to recognise the forms if the viewer is to understand the symbolism - unfortunately they are completely meaningless to me.', '2011-06-17 12:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6446033, 956968, 67258, '<td valign="top">I have absolutely no idea what your title means, and I don''t understand the photograph at all; that said it is certainly aesthetically pleasing.</td>', 'I have absolutely no idea what your title means, and I don''t understand the photograph at all; that said it is certainly aesthetically pleasing.', '2011-06-17 12:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6446035, 956940, 67258, '<td valign="top">Pretty colours, and technically competent photo, but I don''t get what it symbolises.</td>', 'Pretty colours, and technically competent photo, but I don''t get what it symbolises.', '2011-06-17 12:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6446049, 956835, 114969, '<td valign="top">Luxe, calme et volupté. I like your poetry tastes ;-) Great shot.</td>', 'Luxe, calme et volupté. I like your poetry tastes ;-) Great shot.', '2011-06-17 12:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6446179, 957019, 131377, '<td valign="top">I had to look at this for quite a few seconds to see what it was, lol.</td>', 'I had to look at this for quite a few seconds to see what it was, lol.', '2011-06-17 14:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6446180, 956826, 131377, '<td valign="top">That''s a big teardrop!</td>', 'That''s a big teardrop!', '2011-06-17 14:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6446190, 957008, 131377, '<td valign="top">Darn it, now I have to go to town and buy chips &amp; salsa. (Is garlic usually purple? I don''t think I have ever seen that before)<br/> <br/>Society seems to keep slipping back &amp; forth from not caring at all about what they eat to caring way too much. One doctor will tell you one thing, and another will tell you something totally different. It''s so hard to know what is good for you and what is not in a world that has both fat people and starving people. I love your message. It comes across loud and clear. :)</td>', 'Darn it, now I have to go to town and buy chips & salsa. (Is garlic usually purple? I don''t think I have ever seen that before) Society seems to keep slipping back & forth from not caring at all about what they eat to caring way too much. One doctor will tell you one thing, and another will tell you something totally different. It''s so hard to know what is good for you and what is not in a world that has both fat people and starving people. I love your message. It comes across loud and clear. :)', '2011-06-17 14:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6446191, 956884, 131377, '<td valign="top">You need an old man''s dress shoe at the end!</td>', 'You need an old man''s dress shoe at the end!', '2011-06-17 14:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6446193, 956991, 131377, '<td valign="top">Nice colubrid. :)</td>', 'Nice colubrid. :)', '2011-06-17 14:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6446194, 957009, 131377, '<td valign="top">This picture makes me want to go on a cruise. :)</td>', 'This picture makes me want to go on a cruise. :)', '2011-06-17 14:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6446195, 956177, 131377, '<td valign="top">Your dictator sits in a lawn chair?</td>', 'Your dictator sits in a lawn chair?', '2011-06-17 14:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6446198, 956873, 131377, '<td valign="top">I would be nervous at seeing golf clubs in a dumpster. Please tell me that''s just a rust stain.<br/> <br/>The only thing I really don''t like about this picture is the angle... I can''t decide which way to turn my head. It makes me feel dizzy looking at it as it is. Of course, that''s just my personal taste &amp; shouldn''t be counted as definite. Alot of people would have a hard time taking an interesting photo of a dumpster. Good job. :)</td>', 'I would be nervous at seeing golf clubs in a dumpster. Please tell me that''s just a rust stain. The only thing I really don''t like about this picture is the angle... I can''t decide which way to turn my head. It makes me feel dizzy looking at it as it is. Of course, that''s just my personal taste & shouldn''t be counted as definite. Alot of people would have a hard time taking an interesting photo of a dumpster. Good job. :)', '2011-06-17 15:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6446204, 956637, 131377, '<td valign="top">LOL that''s pretty awesome. :)</td>', 'LOL that''s pretty awesome. :)', '2011-06-17 15:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6446213, 957018, 131377, '<td valign="top">Eeeew! LOL! I''m not even going to ask what that toothbrush was used for. I can see some of your putty, but I only saw it after I said, "How are they standing up?" This was a good idea and it made me giggle. :)</td>', 'Eeeew! LOL! I''m not even going to ask what that toothbrush was used for. I can see some of your putty, but I only saw it after I said, "How are they standing up?" This was a good idea and it made me giggle. :)', '2011-06-17 15:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6446241, 957009, 133771, '<td valign="top">wonderful in sepia</td>', 'wonderful in sepia', '2011-06-17 16:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6446247, 956613, 133771, '<td valign="top">dreamlike! It would seem perfekt to me, if a real rose has been used.</td>', 'dreamlike! It would seem perfekt to me, if a real rose has been used.', '2011-06-17 16:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6446257, 956979, 114225, '<td valign="top">This photo has a definite movement to it. My eyes flow so naturally from the top to the bottom.</td>', 'This photo has a definite movement to it. My eyes flow so naturally from the top to the bottom.', '2011-06-17 16:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6446262, 956452, 114225, '<td valign="top">It''s interesting, I believe I see what you were attempting. But for me, it''s not quite working. I think one of the big things is time is often shown on the x axis as going now -&gt; future. This seems to be going the opposite, which is really messing with my interpretation.</td>', 'It''s interesting, I believe I see what you were attempting. But for me, it''s not quite working. I think one of the big things is time is often shown on the x axis as going now -> future. This seems to be going the opposite, which is really messing with my interpretation.', '2011-06-17 16:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6446265, 956816, 114225, '<td valign="top">I''m struggling with the layout of this image. It took me about 10 seconds of looking at the photo to figure out they were toy cows, and I''m still not sure what the cubes are.</td>', 'I''m struggling with the layout of this image. It took me about 10 seconds of looking at the photo to figure out they were toy cows, and I''m still not sure what the cubes are.', '2011-06-17 16:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6446272, 956941, 114225, '<td valign="top">Ok, I see what you are going for. I really had to examine the object to figure it out (probably because I don''t play poker and my wife doesn''t wear makeup).<br/> <br/>It''s interesting that the tape measure and the flower cross the center line.<br/> <br/>Editing to fix some typos.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-06-22 07:26:05.</i></td>', 'Ok, I see what you are going for. I really had to examine the object to figure it out (probably because I don''t play poker and my wife doesn''t wear makeup). It''s interesting that the tape measure and the flower cross the center line. Editing to fix some typos.', '2011-06-17 16:55:09.000000', '2011-06-22 08:26:05.000000', 1),
(6446274, 956851, 114225, '<td valign="top">For me, the yellow cast is really hurting this image. It somehow makes the food un-appetizing.</td>', 'For me, the yellow cast is really hurting this image. It somehow makes the food un-appetizing.', '2011-06-17 16:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6446275, 956945, 114225, '<td valign="top">I''m hoping you included some information on what your thoughts were for this. I''m having a very hard time figuring out how Africa, flowers, crumbs, and pills go together.</td>', 'I''m hoping you included some information on what your thoughts were for this. I''m having a very hard time figuring out how Africa, flowers, crumbs, and pills go together.', '2011-06-17 16:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6446278, 956843, 114225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful still life shot. Really enjoying the lighting and colors. But I''m struggling on the symbolism.</td>', 'Beautiful still life shot. Really enjoying the lighting and colors. But I''m struggling on the symbolism.', '2011-06-17 17:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6446335, 956797, 47470, '<td valign="top">I would have loved to see some textured lighting on this to give it some kind of location (like light through blinders or something like that) since the background doesn''t give any indication as to where these items were found.  I also think there is too much sharpening and a lot of artifacting.  I''m not sure if that was caused by your camera or your editing process, but it does affect the quality of the image.</td>', 'I would have loved to see some textured lighting on this to give it some kind of location (like light through blinders or something like that) since the background doesn''t give any indication as to where these items were found.  I also think there is too much sharpening and a lot of artifacting.  I''m not sure if that was caused by your camera or your editing process, but it does affect the quality of the image.', '2011-06-17 19:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6446339, 956952, 47470, '<td valign="top">With slightly different lighting, you could have hid the wrinkles in the fabric while highlighting the blade.  A highlight on the blade would have added a bit more of a menacing feeling to the image.  I like that the vegetable looks a bit like a human heart.</td>', 'With slightly different lighting, you could have hid the wrinkles in the fabric while highlighting the blade.  A highlight on the blade would have added a bit more of a menacing feeling to the image.  I like that the vegetable looks a bit like a human heart.', '2011-06-17 19:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6446341, 956403, 47470, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and composition.</td>', 'Great lighting and composition.', '2011-06-17 19:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6446347, 956920, 133771, '<td valign="top">looks very classical...</td>', 'looks very classical...', '2011-06-17 19:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6446348, 956903, 47470, '<td valign="top">I wish you had used a shallower depth of field and/or moved the glasses farther from the background so you could blur out the horizon line and the texture of the background.  I love the way the light looks on the glass, but I''m not completely sold on the light on the background.  Maybe if it was a more subtle and smooth gradient?</td>', 'I wish you had used a shallower depth of field and/or moved the glasses farther from the background so you could blur out the horizon line and the texture of the background.  I love the way the light looks on the glass, but I''m not completely sold on the light on the background.  Maybe if it was a more subtle and smooth gradient?', '2011-06-17 19:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6446350, 956795, 47470, '<td valign="top">I wish you had used a deeper depth of field so that everything was in focus.</td>', 'I wish you had used a deeper depth of field so that everything was in focus.', '2011-06-17 19:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6446355, 956870, 47470, '<td valign="top">This is such a gorgeous image.  The color, the composition, and the depth of field are all very well done.  I think that based on the most common definition of a "still life" this image won''t receive as high of a score as it would have in a different challenge.  I think this probably would have even held up better in the Free Study (which says a lot of positives about the image!).  Still a great photo, even if it doesn''t ribbon.  (Not voting.)</td>', 'This is such a gorgeous image.  The color, the composition, and the depth of field are all very well done.  I think that based on the most common definition of a "still life" this image won''t receive as high of a score as it would have in a different challenge.  I think this probably would have even held up better in the Free Study (which says a lot of positives about the image!).  Still a great photo, even if it doesn''t ribbon.  (Not voting.)', '2011-06-17 19:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6446356, 956057, 47470, '<td valign="top">The title and the "static" bring the image together.</td>', 'The title and the "static" bring the image together.', '2011-06-17 19:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6446362, 957012, 47470, '<td valign="top">"The anguished arancia."  That''s what this image makes me think anyway : )  Looking forward to the Photographer''s Notes on this one to hear about the thoughts and ideas behind the photo.</td>', '"The anguished arancia."  That''s what this image makes me think anyway : )  Looking forward to the Photographer''s Notes on this one to hear about the thoughts and ideas behind the photo.', '2011-06-17 20:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6446467, 956834, 124815, '<td valign="top">This is a fabulous image! Great idea, wonderfully done. Reminds me of a lot of French movies that stay with you - "Seraphine" was the last one for instance. Congratulations. 10</td>', 'This is a fabulous image! Great idea, wonderfully done. Reminds me of a lot of French movies that stay with you - "Seraphine" was the last one for instance. Congratulations. 10', '2011-06-18 00:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6446537, 956968, 106484, '<td valign="top">6</td>', '6', '2011-06-18 04:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6446578, 956870, 48227, '<td valign="top">Excellent! 10</td>', 'Excellent! 10', '2011-06-18 09:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
