(6448825, 956918, 16106, '<td valign="top">The leaves are a bit blown, but the composition has an elegance and the symbolism is quite simple and lovely.</td>', 'The leaves are a bit blown, but the composition has an elegance and the symbolism is quite simple and lovely.', '2011-06-20 21:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448828, 956987, 16106, '<td valign="top">The symbolism is rather opaque, but intriguing. The colors are lovely and well balanced and the items displayed seem layered with hidden meaning. On the whole it reminds me of a Cornell box; which I love.</td>', 'The symbolism is rather opaque, but intriguing. The colors are lovely and well balanced and the items displayed seem layered with hidden meaning. On the whole it reminds me of a Cornell box; which I love.', '2011-06-20 21:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448842, 956978, 16106, '<td valign="top">Ought to ribbon, nice color tie in with the tie in the photograph, the baubles on the pony tail and the peaches. The blue of the bowl sets that triumvirate off well. My only issue is with the reliance on photographs to make the allegory obvious, since an image is not a symbol but a representation. The shorn pigtail, and the peaches are a lovely evocation of fleeting youth, but the images are the easy path to clear communication, skipping subtle symbols, and something of a cheat.</td>', 'Ought to ribbon, nice color tie in with the tie in the photograph, the baubles on the pony tail and the peaches. The blue of the bowl sets that triumvirate off well. My only issue is with the reliance on photographs to make the allegory obvious, since an image is not a symbol but a representation. The shorn pigtail, and the peaches are a lovely evocation of fleeting youth, but the images are the easy path to clear communication, skipping subtle symbols, and something of a cheat.', '2011-06-20 22:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448855, 956940, 134585, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.</td>', 'Nice colors.', '2011-06-20 22:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448933, 956589, 114285, '<td valign="top">I love the old photo, well composed shot, top 10.</td>', 'I love the old photo, well composed shot, top 10.', '2011-06-20 23:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448936, 956965, 114285, '<td valign="top">Christophe for sure, I''m guessing this is the political climate in Europe at the moment, something radical needs to change, and indeed it will. Ribbon for sure.</td>', 'Christophe for sure, I''m guessing this is the political climate in Europe at the moment, something radical needs to change, and indeed it will. Ribbon for sure.', '2011-06-20 23:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
