(6449548, 956895, 100831, '<td valign="top">such beauty... lovely lines and tones and never-ended-ness (you would have a better word for that I guess but it suits the title, for sure). The light is gorgeous.</td>', 'such beauty... lovely lines and tones and never-ended-ness (you would have a better word for that I guess but it suits the title, for sure). The light is gorgeous.', '2011-06-21 20:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
