(6449555, 956918, 58634, '<td valign="top">The image, along with it''s title is very striking. Thank you for ncluding a petal mid-drop.<br/>This is gorgeous.<br/> <br/>ETA: You''re the only image I gave a 9 to, which is the highest I gave. Don''t know if you''ll ribbon, but I love this, and IMHO, you deserve it.</td>', 'The image, along with it''s title is very striking. Thank you for ncluding a petal mid-drop.This is gorgeous. ETA: You''re the only image I gave a 9 to, which is the highest I gave. Don''t know if you''ll ribbon, but I love this, and IMHO, you deserve it.', '2011-06-21 20:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6449591, 957007, 47470, '<td valign="top">The lighting on the car is great--just enough so you can tell what it is despite the blur.  I wish there was just the tiniest bit more space on top so the bottle wouldn''t feel so crowded.</td>', 'The lighting on the car is great--just enough so you can tell what it is despite the blur.  I wish there was just the tiniest bit more space on top so the bottle wouldn''t feel so crowded.', '2011-06-21 21:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
