(6449913, 956900, 18778, '<td valign="top">I started to comment during voting and since no one else has...<br/>The first thing I notice is that the flowers are artificial.  Also, I''m wondering if a brighter light source would have provided you with more contrast seeing as you choose to use blk/wht?  Perhaps would have given you more depth. As a viewer- I''m wanting to know the meaning of the tin objects in the lower left- but I can''t quite make them out.  I do love the title!  That''s what I called my Gram...<br/></td>', 'I started to comment during voting and since no one else has...The first thing I notice is that the flowers are artificial.  Also, I''m wondering if a brighter light source would have provided you with more contrast seeing as you choose to use blk/wht?  Perhaps would have given you more depth. As a viewer- I''m wanting to know the meaning of the tin objects in the lower left- but I can''t quite make them out.  I do love the title!  That''s what I called my Gram...', '2011-06-22 02:46:51.000000', NULL, 0),
