(6450017, 956918, 59029, '<td valign="top">Very well done, Wendy.  Grats on the blue!</td>', 'Very well done, Wendy.  Grats on the blue!', '2011-06-22 08:40:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(6450018, 956918, 121916, '<td valign="top">What a beautifully symbolic image.   It deserves the blue, and also to be shown in other venues.<br/></td>', 'What a beautifully symbolic image.   It deserves the blue, and also to be shown in other venues.', '2011-06-22 08:41:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(6450019, 956843, 59029, '<td valign="top">Under pressure, indeed!  Good work, it takes a lot of pressing and distilling to produce quality product.  Congrats on the red :-)</td>', 'Under pressure, indeed!  Good work, it takes a lot of pressing and distilling to produce quality product.  Congrats on the red :-)', '2011-06-22 08:42:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(6450020, 956918, 98339, '<td valign="top">very, very well done...having had a mother that suffered from Alzheimer''s this is very visual.  Congrats</td>', 'very, very well done...having had a mother that suffered from Alzheimer''s this is very visual.  Congrats', '2011-06-22 08:42:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(6450022, 956965, 59029, '<td valign="top">Yep, that pretty much sums you up, Christophe - a big wild rogue being tamed by a bunch of straight (and some slightly bent) inferior beings :-)  Great work, congrats on the yellow! :-)</td>', 'Yep, that pretty much sums you up, Christophe - a big wild rogue being tamed by a bunch of straight (and some slightly bent) inferior beings :-)  Great work, congrats on the yellow! :-)', '2011-06-22 08:43:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(6450043, 956843, 103142, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by MAK:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by whiteroom:</b></div><hr/><i> i would have titled it "hard pressed" or something..  congrats on the ribbon </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>That''s great Leslie, I am so crap at titles.. The meaning behind this image was supposed to convey "even though the pressure seems unbearable at times there is usually something wonderful at the end of it." bit too long for a title but yours made it work. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>If you would have had a title like that (though distilled a little :) you would have slaughtered my image.<br/> <br/>This shot is so incredibly stunning, I gave it a 7, but simply because my little brain couldn''t come up with the symbolism. It seemed more like an informative shot than a symbolic shot. That''s my fault and lack of imagination -- though I looked at it a long time trying to figure it out. Absolutely beautiful -- and congrats on the red!</td>', 'Originally posted by MAK: Originally posted by whiteroom: i would have titled it "hard pressed" or something..  congrats on the ribbon   That''s great Leslie, I am so crap at titles.. The meaning behind this image was supposed to convey "even though the pressure seems unbearable at times there is usually something wonderful at the end of it." bit too long for a title but yours made it work.   If you would have had a title like that (though distilled a little :) you would have slaughtered my image. This shot is so incredibly stunning, I gave it a 7, but simply because my little brain couldn''t come up with the symbolism. It seemed more like an informative shot than a symbolic shot. That''s my fault and lack of imagination -- though I looked at it a long time trying to figure it out. Absolutely beautiful -- and congrats on the red!', '2011-06-22 09:04:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(6450044, 956965, 103142, '<td valign="top">I actually like the gritty surface -- it adds to the overall feeling of the shot. A clean black surface doesn''t really fit.<br/> <br/>Congrats again! Art''s right -- we need a rubber stamp. :)</td>', 'I actually like the gritty surface -- it adds to the overall feeling of the shot. A clean black surface doesn''t really fit. Congrats again! Art''s right -- we need a rubber stamp. :)', '2011-06-22 09:06:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(6450046, 956920, 103142, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the HM!! (What are those funny looking film things in the white squares? :)</td>', 'Congrats on the HM!! (What are those funny looking film things in the white squares? :)', '2011-06-22 09:07:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(6450047, 956979, 103142, '<td valign="top">Oh -- I missed the cicada the first time around!! I was too proud of myself for knowing that rosemary stood for remembrance, I guess. :)<br/> <br/>Congrats on the HM!!</td>', 'Oh -- I missed the cicada the first time around!! I was too proud of myself for knowing that rosemary stood for remembrance, I guess. :) Congrats on the HM!!', '2011-06-22 09:08:16.000000', NULL, 0),
