(6450053, 956589, 103142, '<td valign="top">I''m so sorry about the loss of you dad!! What a beautiful memorial -- it was an 8 from me.<br/> <br/>Congrats on the top 10!</td>', 'I''m so sorry about the loss of you dad!! What a beautiful memorial -- it was an 8 from me. Congrats on the top 10!', '2011-06-22 09:11:46.000000', NULL, 0),
