(6450219, 956859, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh!  I don''t think she''d have been a junior trooper in the 1800s.... no cars or seatbelts to buckle at that time.  Interesting collection of stuff, though.</td>', 'Heh!  I don''t think she''d have been a junior trooper in the 1800s.... no cars or seatbelts to buckle at that time.  Interesting collection of stuff, though.', '2011-06-22 10:59:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(6450220, 956979, 54645, '<td valign="top">Classic, you have a special relationship with soft light.</td>', 'Classic, you have a special relationship with soft light.', '2011-06-22 10:59:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(6450223, 956964, 54645, '<td valign="top">Beautiful work. One to come back and study.</td>', 'Beautiful work. One to come back and study.', '2011-06-22 11:01:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(6450224, 956987, 23484, '<td valign="top">Excellent job T. That''s my teammate!!</td>', 'Excellent job T. That''s my teammate!!', '2011-06-22 11:01:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(6450226, 956987, 11769, '<td valign="top">The little girls expression, holding the beetle, the framing, everything about this is perfect. Congrats on top 10 and entry in the morgue.</td>', 'The little girls expression, holding the beetle, the framing, everything about this is perfect. Congrats on top 10 and entry in the morgue.', '2011-06-22 11:01:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(6450227, 956057, 54645, '<td valign="top">I like Brian''s comment, didn''t make the connection (ouch, bad pun).</td>', 'I like Brian''s comment, didn''t make the connection (ouch, bad pun).', '2011-06-22 11:02:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(6450229, 956971, 54645, '<td valign="top">A wild find.</td>', 'A wild find.', '2011-06-22 11:03:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(6450231, 956918, 54645, '<td valign="top">Congrats, a lovely sentiment. Symbolism is spot on. At first, I didn''t like the floating vase, but it is actually a nice touch...patient''s with AD can feel isolated in their own mind.</td>', 'Congrats, a lovely sentiment. Symbolism is spot on. At first, I didn''t like the floating vase, but it is actually a nice touch...patient''s with AD can feel isolated in their own mind.', '2011-06-22 11:08:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(6450232, 956968, 54645, '<td valign="top">An image the evokes longing. Skills lost, but on the surface waiting to be rediscovered.</td>', 'An image the evokes longing. Skills lost, but on the surface waiting to be rediscovered.', '2011-06-22 11:10:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(6450233, 956997, 54645, '<td valign="top">An impressive still life. I had to go read the poem to get the full effect; regardless, I get a strong sense of a desire to rise above the anonymity/oppression of life. Screw it all. ;)</td>', 'An impressive still life. I had to go read the poem to get the full effect; regardless, I get a strong sense of a desire to rise above the anonymity/oppression of life. Screw it all. ;)', '2011-06-22 11:16:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(6450244, 957017, 11769, '<td valign="top">This brings to mind this story. Went to a hardware store for a pane of glass 8 by 14. I told the youngster working that department and he went off to cut me some glass. Came back with a pane measuring 9 by 12. <br/> <br/>The kid had just graduated High School and didn''t know how to read a ruler.</td>', 'This brings to mind this story. Went to a hardware store for a pane of glass 8 by 14. I told the youngster working that department and he went off to cut me some glass. Came back with a pane measuring 9 by 12.  The kid had just graduated High School and didn''t know how to read a ruler.', '2011-06-22 11:41:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(6450246, 956918, 117534, '<td valign="top">Was gone yesterday and last night didn''t see this contest end. Congratulations Wendy!!!  Still very touching!!!!</td>', 'Was gone yesterday and last night didn''t see this contest end. Congratulations Wendy!!!  Still very touching!!!!', '2011-06-22 11:43:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(6450248, 956965, 117534, '<td valign="top">Guess we can say you NAILED this challenge!! LOL Congratulations</td>', 'Guess we can say you NAILED this challenge!! LOL Congratulations', '2011-06-22 11:45:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(6450257, 956979, 16148, '<td valign="top">Excellent work!  Interesting collection of items and your lighting/tones evoke memory.  You have been posting some nice stuff.  Keep it up!</td>', 'Excellent work!  Interesting collection of items and your lighting/tones evoke memory.  You have been posting some nice stuff.  Keep it up!', '2011-06-22 12:05:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(6450259, 956918, 16148, '<td valign="top">Congratulations!  Well deserved blue.</td>', 'Congratulations!  Well deserved blue.', '2011-06-22 12:08:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(6450261, 956835, 16148, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your posthumous!  Love the complimentary colors, composition, and DOF.</td>', 'Congratulations on your posthumous!  Love the complimentary colors, composition, and DOF.', '2011-06-22 12:17:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(6450265, 957011, 19825, '<td valign="top">Nice job on another top ten finish. Beautiful image.</td>', 'Nice job on another top ten finish. Beautiful image.', '2011-06-22 12:24:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(6450274, 956965, 83026, '<td valign="top">Never in a million years I would be able to come up with such an idea.</td>', 'Never in a million years I would be able to come up with such an idea.', '2011-06-22 12:34:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(6450276, 956918, 119747, '<td valign="top">Congrats! Powerful photo</td>', 'Congrats! Powerful photo', '2011-06-22 12:45:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(6450277, 956997, 50695, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bspurgeon:</b></div><hr/><i> An impressive still life. I had to go read the poem to get the full effect; regardless, I get a strong sense of a desire to rise above the anonymity/oppression of life. Screw it all. ;) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I have a confession to make. I chose "invictus" because it was just the most ridiculous and pretentious title I could think of. :)</td>', 'Originally posted by bspurgeon: An impressive still life. I had to go read the poem to get the full effect; regardless, I get a strong sense of a desire to rise above the anonymity/oppression of life. Screw it all. ;)   I have a confession to make. I chose "invictus" because it was just the most ridiculous and pretentious title I could think of. :)', '2011-06-22 12:47:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(6450279, 956928, 19825, '<td valign="top">I loved this one, and I meant to come back and comment on it during voting. This was in my top three. The textures and color of the apple are gorgeous. Is there a handle on that blade? If so I might have liked to be able to make it out a bit more. Perhaps my monitor is out of adjustment.</td>', 'I loved this one, and I meant to come back and comment on it during voting. This was in my top three. The textures and color of the apple are gorgeous. Is there a handle on that blade? If so I might have liked to be able to make it out a bit more. Perhaps my monitor is out of adjustment.', '2011-06-22 12:48:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(6450283, 956987, 50695, '<td valign="top">great framing in every sense. if that''s your Da then you must be kafkaesque.</td>', 'great framing in every sense. if that''s your Da then you must be kafkaesque.', '2011-06-22 12:54:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(6450290, 956994, 19825, '<td valign="top">I liked your image during voting, but loved it that much more after reading your comments and learning what you were shooting for. I have the mind of an engineer. I am pretty good at things that are literal and spacial, and perhaps not so good at pulling out the subtle and symbolic. I wish this challenge had allowed you to provide the viewer with a bit more context during voting. For those like me that are more challenged at interpreting symbolism, it would have made each image more meaningful.<br/> <br/>I am hoping the light on the back wall represents a glimmer of hope that we can pull things out before it is too late.</td>', 'I liked your image during voting, but loved it that much more after reading your comments and learning what you were shooting for. I have the mind of an engineer. I am pretty good at things that are literal and spacial, and perhaps not so good at pulling out the subtle and symbolic. I wish this challenge had allowed you to provide the viewer with a bit more context during voting. For those like me that are more challenged at interpreting symbolism, it would have made each image more meaningful. I am hoping the light on the back wall represents a glimmer of hope that we can pull things out before it is too late.', '2011-06-22 13:04:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(6450307, 957019, 74588, '<td valign="top">the eye is gone</td>', 'the eye is gone', '2011-06-22 13:15:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(6450308, 956987, 68504, '<td valign="top">thanks, peeps.  sweet to morgue out on page one.<br/> <br/>herfotoman''s comment gives me great pause: possibly I have dealt too lightly with archetypal symbols, and he is sensitive enough to sense it.  <br/></td>', 'thanks, peeps.  sweet to morgue out on page one. herfotoman''s comment gives me great pause: possibly I have dealt too lightly with archetypal symbols, and he is sensitive enough to sense it.  ', '2011-06-22 13:18:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(6450310, 956918, 118154, '<td valign="top">Congratulations, a worthy winner.</td>', 'Congratulations, a worthy winner.', '2011-06-22 13:25:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(6450311, 956843, 118154, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the ribbon.</td>', 'Congratulations on the ribbon.', '2011-06-22 13:26:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(6450312, 956834, 50695, '<td valign="top">I saw it as a play on the french term "nature mort" (sp?)</td>', 'I saw it as a play on the french term "nature mort" (sp?)', '2011-06-22 13:26:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(6450313, 956918, 114969, '<td valign="top">Fantastic idea. I love the strong contrast, it is a symbol by itself. Congratulations on your ribbon.</td>', 'Fantastic idea. I love the strong contrast, it is a symbol by itself. Congratulations on your ribbon.', '2011-06-22 13:27:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(6450314, 957012, 50695, '<td valign="top">8 from me</td>', '8 from me', '2011-06-22 13:28:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(6450315, 956965, 118154, '<td valign="top">Glad someone explained this as I thought it was just some poor DIY attempt.<br/>Congratulations once more.</td>', 'Glad someone explained this as I thought it was just some poor DIY attempt.Congratulations once more.', '2011-06-22 13:29:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(6450317, 956920, 118154, '<td valign="top">One of my top picks,Congratulations.</td>', 'One of my top picks,Congratulations.', '2011-06-22 13:30:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(6450318, 956843, 114969, '<td valign="top">Extremely nice picture, it was one of my top pick. I love the color harmony, it contrasts with the inherent violence of the pressure. And it also makes me hungry, now I want a peach! ;-) Congratulations.</td>', 'Extremely nice picture, it was one of my top pick. I love the color harmony, it contrasts with the inherent violence of the pressure. And it also makes me hungry, now I want a peach! ;-) Congratulations.', '2011-06-22 13:31:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(6450320, 956955, 74588, '<td valign="top">somebodyis good<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-06-22 12:41:14.</i></td>', 'somebodyis good', '2011-06-22 13:40:26.000000', '2011-06-22 13:41:14.000000', 0),
(6450329, 956765, 132967, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for the technical tips.  I didn''t even think of the basic vs. pastel colors.  I was visiting my parents'' house and just used what I brought with me for the visit.  I''m still learning the ins and outs of detailed photography.  I tend to get a lot of what I would consider "lucky" shots.  By the way, this was in no way intended to be a political statement.  Rather, it was a statement of morality and the sacredness of life.  I''m glad I have my two boys (my 4 month old son is the one in the ultrasound).</td>', 'Thanks everyone for the technical tips.  I didn''t even think of the basic vs. pastel colors.  I was visiting my parents'' house and just used what I brought with me for the visit.  I''m still learning the ins and outs of detailed photography.  I tend to get a lot of what I would consider "lucky" shots.  By the way, this was in no way intended to be a political statement.  Rather, it was a statement of morality and the sacredness of life.  I''m glad I have my two boys (my 4 month old son is the one in the ultrasound).', '2011-06-22 13:50:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(6450333, 956834, 68504, '<td valign="top">a blue ribbon of its own.<br/> <br/>"nature morte"<br/> <br/>and Everybody, do see the movie "Seraphine," starring and directed by a marvelous Belgian.</td>', 'a blue ribbon of its own. "nature morte" and Everybody, do see the movie "Seraphine," starring and directed by a marvelous Belgian.', '2011-06-22 13:55:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(6450343, 956997, 54645, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> <br/> <br/>I have a confession to make. I chose "invictus" because it was just the most ridiculous and pretentious title I could think of. :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Hence the extensive research! I did get to read a poem I had never seen, nor did I know the author (William Henley). Ha! Anyway, from the poem:<br/> <br/> <br/>OUT of the night that covers me,	 <br/>  Black as the Pit from pole to pole,	 <br/>I thank whatever gods may be	 <br/>  For my unconquerable soul.<br/> <br/>With all of those eyes watching the bold screw, you didn''t need a title, but ridiculous and pretentious is fun.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-06-22 13:19:45.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous:  I have a confession to make. I chose "invictus" because it was just the most ridiculous and pretentious title I could think of. :)   Hence the extensive research! I did get to read a poem I had never seen, nor did I know the author (William Henley). Ha! Anyway, from the poem:  OUT of the night that covers me,	   Black as the Pit from pole to pole,	 I thank whatever gods may be	   For my unconquerable soul. With all of those eyes watching the bold screw, you didn''t need a title, but ridiculous and pretentious is fun.', '2011-06-22 14:15:50.000000', '2011-06-22 14:19:45.000000', 0),
(6450353, 956057, 74588, '<td valign="top">i gave this a 8<br/>but never realized its greatness</td>', 'i gave this a 8but never realized its greatness', '2011-06-22 14:55:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(6450361, 956918, 89723, '<td valign="top">Congrats! Well done.</td>', 'Congrats! Well done.', '2011-06-22 15:20:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(6450393, 956057, 50864, '<td valign="top">Another amazing image John.  It gets better every time I look at it and I do appreciate Brian''s comment.</td>', 'Another amazing image John.  It gets better every time I look at it and I do appreciate Brian''s comment.', '2011-06-22 16:07:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(6450403, 956843, 16106, '<td valign="top">Grats on the ribbon for this beautifully lit image, but I was hoping you would explain what symbolism you saw in it and what the assembled objects stood for. It is a lovely still life.</td>', 'Grats on the ribbon for this beautifully lit image, but I was hoping you would explain what symbolism you saw in it and what the assembled objects stood for. It is a lovely still life.', '2011-06-22 16:26:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(6450463, 956843, 3746, '<td valign="top">Nice! Well done matey.</td>', 'Nice! Well done matey.', '2011-06-22 18:50:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(6450488, 956873, 102278, '<td valign="top">Really liked this. Got an 8 from me. Like a murder scene.</td>', 'Really liked this. Got an 8 from me. Like a murder scene.', '2011-06-22 19:18:15.000000', NULL, 0);
