(6457468, 956541, 134184, '<td valign="top">The water droplets on the spider web caught my eye on the foggy morning in Melbourne Australia. I grabbed my camera and tripod ,shot a couple of images and thought that others may like the shot too. I figured that "symbolic still life" could be looked at from outside of the square! and that most of us use computers and check out web sites........ there you go ... my interpretation of the perfect web (site) in perfect still life xCJ</td>', 'The water droplets on the spider web caught my eye on the foggy morning in Melbourne Australia. I grabbed my camera and tripod ,shot a couple of images and thought that others may like the shot too. I figured that "symbolic still life" could be looked at from outside of the square! and that most of us use computers and check out web sites........ there you go ... my interpretation of the perfect web (site) in perfect still life xCJ', '2011-07-01 03:31:22.000000', NULL, 0),
