(6519690, 956834, 137678, '<td valign="top">I like the black humour involved in this image. It would be great to see a whole series of photos based on the idea of poisoning. One image is not enough, I want to see a full scale project. Excellent work.</td>', 'I like the black humour involved in this image. It would be great to see a whole series of photos based on the idea of poisoning. One image is not enough, I want to see a full scale project. Excellent work.', '2011-08-29 15:34:45.000000', NULL, 0),
