(7249973, 956918, 58634, '<td valign="top">Years may have gone by since this challenge entry, but I still often think of this image. I''ll never forget the overwhelming feeling of both sadness and distress it gave me. <br/> <br/>It resonates even more now that my grandma is dealing with dementia/Alzheimers. I recently visited her and she didn''t recognize me for several minutes which left me in absolute shock and with such a strong feeling of emptiness.  <br/> <br/>Thanks, yet again for this image. It''ll be forever memorable to me.</td>', 'Years may have gone by since this challenge entry, but I still often think of this image. I''ll never forget the overwhelming feeling of both sadness and distress it gave me.  It resonates even more now that my grandma is dealing with dementia/Alzheimers. I recently visited her and she didn''t recognize me for several minutes which left me in absolute shock and with such a strong feeling of emptiness.   Thanks, yet again for this image. It''ll be forever memorable to me.', '2014-08-10 20:14:22.000000', NULL, 0);
